s admirers and rivals, and lives a colorless life alongside his friends Tsubaki Sawabe and Ryouta Watari. However, everything changes when he meets a beautiful violinist, Kaori Miyazono, who stirs up his world and sets him on a journey to face music again.\\nBased on the manga series of the same name, Shigatsu wa Kimi no Uso approaches the story of Kousei's recovery as he discovers that music is more than playing each note perfectly, and a single melody can bring in the fresh spring air of April.\\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"AbTfMbmucpI\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Kaori Miyazono\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/53369/image/tiny-78786eb9f618c9c629ba454eb87ce5d6.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Risa Taneda\"},{\"name\":\"Tsubaki Sawabe\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/53370/image/tiny-3a6565bd8331434941562a1542546b75.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ayane Sakura\"},{\"name\":\"Ryouta Watari\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/53371/image/tiny-eb3b67ec6f9f73359e461efa4c0436fd.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ryota Osaka\"},{\"name\":\"Keiko\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":null,\"voiceActor\":\"Eri Suzuki\"},{\"name\":\"Nagi Aiza\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/70649/image/tiny-21ea3ea4ba8d4e984c1deffaea6ad9bb.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ai Kayano\"},{\"name\":\"Takeshi Aiza\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/53372/image/tiny-f7b688e44f51de80d8e00b0b703ec6d7.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yuki Kaji\"},{\"name\":\"Mother Aiza\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":null,\"voiceActor\":\"Atsuko Yuuya\"},{\"name\":\"Saki Arima\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/69564/image/tiny-1f345b40edbbaf7de607226ab8147597.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Mamiko Noto\"},{\"name\":\"Girl\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":null,\"voiceActor\":\"Chinami Hashimot